msgid ""
"When PCP size is greater than 1, PCP stores embedding and LM Head weights as"
" TP×PCP resident shards by default for every supported attention backend. "
"Set `enable_pcp_embedding_lmhead_weight_sharding` to `false` to disable this"
" behavior."
msgstr ""
"当 PCP size 大于 1 时，对于每个受支持的注意力后端，PCP 默认将 embedding 和 LM Head 权重存储为 TP×PCP "
"常驻分片。将 `enable_pcp_embedding_lmhead_weight_sharding` 设置为 `false` 可禁用此行为。"

msgid ""
"- ✅ **Full compatibility**: The basic path or feature combination is supported.\n"
"- 🟠 **Partial compatibility**: The basic path or feature combination is supported with the stated limitations.\n"
"- **Not applicable**: The feature does not apply to the attention backend."
msgstr ""
"- ✅ **完全兼容**：支持基本路径或功能组合。\n"
"- 🟠 **部分兼容**：在所述限制条件下支持基本路径或功能组合。\n"
"- **不适用**：该功能不适用于该注意力后端。"

msgid ""
"With PCP enabled, O-projection weight sharding is on by default for SFA-PCP "
"O-projection and DSA-PCP two-stage O-projection (`wo_a`/`wo_b`). If the "
"weight method or PCP partition does not support sharding, the option is "
"disabled with a warning. Set `enable_pcp_o_proj_weight_sharding` to `false` "
"to disable it. Other attention backends do not use this option. O-projection"
" sharding is incompatible with fine-grained TP for the same modules."
msgstr ""
"启用 PCP 后，SFA-PCP O-projection 和 DSA-PCP 两阶段 O-projection（`wo_a`/`wo_b`）默认开启 "
"O-projection 权重分片。如果权重方法或 PCP 分区不支持分片，该选项将被禁用并给出警告。将 "
"`enable_pcp_o_proj_weight_sharding` 设置为 `false` "
"可禁用它。其他注意力后端不使用该选项。O-projection 分片与相同模块的细粒度 TP 不兼容。"

msgid ""
