msgid "#### Standalone DCP (PCP=1)"
msgstr "#### 独立 DCP（PCP=1）"

msgid ""
"Use the following topology when PCP is disabled "
"(`prefill_context_parallel_size=1`):"
msgstr "当 PCP 被禁用（`prefill_context_parallel_size=1`）时，请使用以下拓扑："

msgid ""
"Standalone DCP reuses only the TP ranks and does not increase the world "
"size."
msgstr "独立 DCP 仅复用 TP rank，不会增加 world size。"

msgid ""
"- For an MLA model:\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- For a sparse SFA model with DCP enabled (`decode_context_parallel_size>1`):\n"
"    - `decode_context_parallel_size == tensor_parallel_size`\n"
"- For a GQA model such as Qwen3-235B:\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`"
msgstr ""
"- 对于 MLA 模型：\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- 对于启用 DCP 的稀疏 SFA 模型（`decode_context_parallel_size>1`）：\n"
"    - `decode_context_parallel_size == tensor_parallel_size`\n"
"- 对于 GQA 模型（如 Qwen3-235B）：\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`"

msgid ""
"- **MLA and SFA**: Support `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE` and `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE * TP_SIZE`.\n"
"- **GQA**: Supports only `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE`. When `TP_SIZE > 1`, `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE * TP_SIZE` is not supported."
msgstr ""
"- **MLA 和 SFA**：支持 `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE` 和 `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE * TP_SIZE`。\n"
"- **GQA**：仅支持 `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE`。当 `TP_SIZE > 1` 时，不支持 `DCP_SIZE = PCP_SIZE * TP_SIZE`。"

