msgid "### Prefill Context Parallel { #prefill-context-parallel }"
msgstr "### Prefill 上下文并行 { #prefill-context-parallel }"

msgid ""
"PCP support is experimental. The following table shows the basic backend "
"support and whether each feature can be combined with PCP:"
msgstr "PCP 支持为实验性特性。下表展示了基本后端支持情况以及各特性是否可与 PCP 组合使用："

msgid "## Usage { #usage }"
msgstr "## 使用方法 { #usage }"

msgid "Set `prefill_context_parallel_size` to the number of PCP ranks:"
msgstr "将 `prefill_context_parallel_size` 设置为 PCP rank 的数量："

msgid ""
"PCP supports MTP with MLA, SFA, and DeepSeek-V4 DSA models, Eagle3 with\n"
"GQA models, and DSpark with SFA, DeepSeek-V4 DSA, and DeepSeek-V4.1 DSA models. The target\n"
"model runs with the configured PCP topology, while the draft model is replicated on every PCP rank\n"
"and runs with a logical PCP size of `1`. Configure PCP only for the target\n"
"model."
msgstr ""
"PCP 支持 MLA、SFA 和 DeepSeek-V4 DSA 模型上的 MTP，GQA 模型上的 Eagle3，以及 SFA、DeepSeek-V4"
" DSA 和 DeepSeek-V4.1 DSA 模型上的 DSpark。目标模型按配置的 PCP 拓扑运行，而草稿模型会在每个 PCP rank "
"上复制，并以逻辑 PCP 大小为 `1` 运行。仅需为目标模型配置 PCP。"

msgid ""
"- In P/D disaggregation, enable PCP only on the prefill (`kv_producer`) engine; the decode (`kv_consumer`) engine must use `prefill_context_parallel_size=1`.\n"
"- With PCP, `MooncakeConnectorV1` and `MooncakeHybridConnector` do not support PP. `MooncakeHybridConnector` does not support DCP.\n"
"- For PP+PCP, use `MooncakeConnectorV2` on [supported models](pipeline_parallel.md).\n"
"- KV cache pooling with PCP supports only `AscendStoreConnector` with `use_layerwise=false`.\n"
"- PCP speculative decoding supports MTP with MLA, SFA, and DeepSeek-V4 DSA models,\n"
"  Eagle3 with GQA models, and DSpark with SFA, DeepSeek-V4 DSA, and DeepSeek-V4.1 DSA models.\n"
"- PCP does not support `FULL` CUDA graphs; use eager mode, `PIECEWISE`, `FULL_AND_PIECEWISE`, or `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`.\n"
"- Encoder-decoder models and LoRA are not supported with PCP.\n"
"- PCP and DCP can be stacked for MLA, SFA, and GQA. See\n"
"  [Combining PCP and DCP](#combining-pcp-and-dcp) for the supported sizes.\n"
"- Adaptive verification is not supported with PCP speculative decoding.\n"
"- Dynamic draft lengths are outside the currently validated scope."
msgstr ""
"- 在 P/D 分离部署中，仅在 prefill（`kv_producer`）引擎上启用 PCP；decode（`kv_consumer`）引擎必须使用 `prefill_context_parallel_size=1`。\n"
"- 使用 PCP 时，`MooncakeConnectorV1` 和 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 不支持 PP。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 不支持 DCP。\n"
"- 对于 PP+PCP，请在[支持的模型](pipeline_parallel.md)上使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2`。\n"
"- 使用 PCP 的 KV cache 池化仅支持 `use_layerwise=false` 的 `AscendStoreConnector`。\n"
"- PCP 投机解码支持 MLA、SFA 和 DeepSeek-V4 DSA 模型上的 MTP，\n"
"  GQA 模型上的 Eagle3，以及 SFA、DeepSeek-V4 DSA 和 DeepSeek-V4.1 DSA 模型上的 DSpark。\n"
"- PCP 不支持 `FULL` CUDA graphs；请使用 eager 模式、`PIECEWISE`、`FULL_AND_PIECEWISE` 或 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`。\n"
"- PCP 不支持编码器-解码器模型和 LoRA。\n"
"- PCP 和 DCP 可针对 MLA、SFA 和 GQA 叠加使用。支持的大小请参见\n"
"  [组合使用 PCP 和 DCP](#combining-pcp-and-dcp)。\n"
"- PCP 投机解码不支持自适应验证。\n"
"- 动态草稿长度不在当前验证范围内。"

msgid "#### Combining PCP and DCP { #combining-pcp-and-dcp }"
msgstr "#### 组合使用 PCP 和 DCP { #combining-pcp-and-dcp }"

msgid ""
"When both PCP and DCP are enabled (`prefill_context_parallel_size>1` and "
"`decode_context_parallel_size>1`), their supported sizes depend on the "
"attention backend. The standalone DCP constraints above do not apply to this"
" topology. Here, `PCP_SIZE` is `prefill_context_parallel_size`, `DCP_SIZE` "
"is `decode_context_parallel_size`, and `TP_SIZE` is `tensor_parallel_size`:"
msgstr ""
"当同时启用 PCP 和 DCP（`prefill_context_parallel_size>1` 且 "
"`decode_context_parallel_size>1`）时，其支持的大小取决于注意力后端。上述独立的 DCP "
"约束不适用于此拓扑。此处，`PCP_SIZE` 为 `prefill_context_parallel_size`，`DCP_SIZE` 为 "
"`decode_context_parallel_size`，`TP_SIZE` 为 `tensor_parallel_size`："

msgid ""
"DCP reuses the ranks introduced by PCP and TP, so stacking DCP does not add "
"ranks beyond the PCP world size. For example, `TP2 + PCP2 + DCP4` is a "
"supported MLA/SFA topology."
msgstr ""
"DCP 复用由 PCP 和 TP 引入的 rank，因此叠加 DCP 不会增加超出 PCP world size 的 rank。例如，`TP2 + "
"PCP2 + DCP4` 是一种受支持的 MLA/SFA 拓扑。"
